      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It is absolutely terrifying to be in public worlds, I feel that at any given moment someone could walk up to you and steal your avatar and crash you with little to no reprocussions for them. Even if there is an anticheat, since the game is free they could just create a new steam account and re install the game and continue doing this. Not only do we NEED and anti cheat but that anti cheat also needs to ban HARDWARE ID’S eliminating the possibility of a player using a VPN to evade IP bans and just creating new accounts to evade bans as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5bef67c8c7ad052c348e3af4",
