      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5be54004efbf8423464d40e7",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I do public worlds extensively and I never meet any crashers anymore. I also never, ever join The Pug, VRC home, or Avatar Testing. I get that there are people out there doing this stuff, but it seems like you only run into them if you're going to the most public and popular places. People hyper-exaggerate how bad it is. It shouldn't happen at all for sure, but if you're getting crashed often I suggest visiting other popular worlds or joining instances a few down the list instead of going for the most populated ones.\n\ntl;dr If you want to get the public experience join instances and worlds that aren't prime crasher bait. We don't need invasive anti-cheat that slows/spies your pc while playing an intensive VR game that sucks up CPU like no other.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
